ainable and healthy commuting</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">📍 <strong>Office Location</strong> – Schlesische Str. 27 C, Building C, 6th floor, 10997 Berlin</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How to Apply</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ready to shape the future talent base of PERGOLUX? Send us your application and resume through our [Career Page](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://pergolux.careers/">https://pergolux.careers/</a>), and follow along for more insights into our culture on [LinkedIn](<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all">https://www.linkedin.com/company/pergolux/posts/?feedView=all</a>).</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">PERGOLUX is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from all backgrounds, we think it's less about ticking every box and more about what you bring to the table!</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/pergolux/talent-acquisition-specialist-berlin-354233","tags":["People & Culture"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin | Global Team","created_at":1795664586},{"slug":"strategic-account-executive-dach-berlin-245893","company_name":"N8N","title":"Strategic Account Executive DACH","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The AI orchestration of your wildest imagination.</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">n8n is the open workflow orchestration platform built for the new era of AI. We give technical teams the freedom of code with the speed of no-code, so they can automate faster, smarter, and without limits. Backed by a fiercely inventive community and 500+ builder-approved integrations, we’re changing the way people bring systems together and scale ideas for impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Since our founding in 2019, we’ve grown into a diverse team of over 260 - working across Europe and the US, connected by a shared builder spirit and with our centre of gravity in Berlin. Along the way, we’ve:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Cultivated a community of more than 650,000 active developers and builders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Earned 190K+ GitHub stars, making us one of the world’s Top 40 most popular projects</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Backed by top investors, from Sequoia’s first German seed to our SAP's recent strategic investment - bringing us to a $5.2bn valuation</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />That’s the company we’ve built. Now we’d love to see what <em>you </em>can build. If you’re applying, try n8n out - whether you’re technical or not - and share a screenshot of your first workflow with us. The easiest place to start is here: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🎯 Your main goal will be to take some of the world's largest organisations from their first n8n deployment to multi-year, seven-figure partnerships, and to help write the playbook for how n8n wins at the very top of the enterprise.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As one of n8n's first Strategic Account Executives, you will own a small portfolio of named accounts drawn from our global top 100. Your portfolio is a deliberate mix: existing customers with clear expansion potential, and greenfield logos where you open the relationship from scratch. This is account-led selling rather than opportunity-led. You run each account like a business, over years rather than quarters.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are early. The strategic motion is new, and you will shape it alongside a small group of senior sellers and n8n leadership. If you are looking for a fully built territory and a playbook to follow, this is not it. If you want to be one of the people who builds it, read on:</p><h3>OWN A NAMED PORTFOLIO</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build multi-year account plans that map business units, regions, executive sponsors and use cases across large, multi-company groups.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Find where n8n already runs inside your accounts and turn that bottom-up adoption into executive-sponsored, company-wide programmes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Open greenfield accounts with research-led outbound to CIOs, CTOs, Heads of AI and platform engineering leaders.</p></li></ul><h3>SELL ON BUSINESS VALUE AT EXECUTIVE LEVEL</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Connect n8n to the board agenda, from AI governance and auditability to efficiency and growth, and lead with outcomes rather than features.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build business cases with real numbers that tie automation and AI agents to each customer's strategic priorities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Multi-thread across engineering, IT, security, risk, finance, legal and procurement, and build champions who sell n8n when you are not in the room.</p></li></ul><h3>STRUCTURE, CLOSE AND EXPAND</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Scope and negotiate multi-year, seven-figure agreements, including enterprise-wide licences, multi-region deployments and deals through system integrators and cloud marketplaces.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run expansion cycles of six to twelve months and greenfield cycles that can stretch longer, through security, legal and global procurement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Customer Success, Solutions Engineering and Partnerships on our biggest bets, and bring in n8n leadership at the moments that matter.</p></li></ul><h3>BUILD THE STRATEGIC MOTION</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help define how n8n sells to its largest customers, from deal structures to executive sponsor programmes and expansion playbooks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take what you learn in the field back to Product, Pricing and leadership.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raise the bar for the AEs around you while staying closest to the customer.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3><strong>Must-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏛️ Strategic accounts:</strong> You have ten or more years of quota-carrying enterprise software sales experience, including at least three years owning a small named portfolio of strategic, Majors or Global 2000 accounts rather than a broad territory.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💰 Seven-figure deals:</strong> You have closed and expanded deals worth €1M+ in total contract value, including multi-year and custom commercial structures, in cycles of six months or more.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧑‍💼 C-suite credibility:</strong> You build relationships with CIOs, CTOs, CFOs and the offices of the COO, and you can talk about their business as well as your product.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📊 Value-based selling:</strong> You have built quantified business cases tied to a customer's strategic priorities, and you are ready to walk us through one in detail.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🌱 Land and expand:</strong> You have turned one team's adoption into an enterprise-wide commitment and grown accounts across business units or regions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎯 Still a hunter:</strong> Even with a named portfolio, you create your own pipeline through outbound and executive networking, and you are comfortable with greenfield cycles of 12 to 18 months.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📈 Track record:</strong> You have consistently hit or exceeded quota over the past three years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧭 Structured selling:</strong> You use a methodology such as MEDDPICC and navigate technical evaluations, security reviews, legal and global procurement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Builder mindset:</strong> You want to help write the playbook rather than run an existing one, and you already use AI in your daily work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📍 Location:</strong> You are based in Germany or Austria, you already have the right to work there, and you are comfortable with regular travel to customers in the territory.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Nice-to-haves</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Technical product background:</strong> You have sold developer tools, cloud infrastructure, data, AI, integration or automation platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤝 Partner-led deals:</strong> You have closed deals with global system integrators or through AWS, Azure or Google Cloud marketplaces.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 Open source or PLG exposure:</strong> You understand how community adoption turns into enterprise revenue.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏦 Existing network:</strong> You already know senior buyers at large organisations in your territory.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why join us?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will take the world's largest organisations from a first n8n deployment to multi-year partnerships, with a product that technical teams already love. You will work closely with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Partnerships and Product, and with n8n leadership at the moments that matter, so your voice shapes how we sell at the top of the enterprise. n8n is growing at an 