aders make sound people decisions and strengthen talent development, performance, and feedback practices.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven ability to create scalable, straightforward processes that support the business without adding unnecessary administrative burden.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Clear judgement and the ability to work with autonomy and pace in a growing, technically demanding environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A collaborative approach to business operations, talent acquisition, onboarding, and the wider employee lifecycle.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Desirable experience</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German-speaking ability and experience with German employment law.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with multidisciplinary teams in a high-tech, high-safety, and industrialised environment, such as defence or space.</p></li></ul><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong><u>Benefits and important information:</u></strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer top-decile compensation packages, bonuses and meaningful equity, to attract exceptional aerospace talent. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Every employee is awarded stock options in the company, you will directly benefit from your own hard work and success. </p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comprehensive relocation support including flights, shipping and visas.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lunch, dinner and drinks provided everyday</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Free access to shared company housing</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please note, we are a fast paced, hyper-scaling startup. You will need to be comfortable working extended hours with high levels of autonomy, ownership, and flexibility, with contracts structured around a 48-hour working week. </p><p style="min-height: