r conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience, one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com,  HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.</p><h2><strong>About the role:</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are hiring an <strong>FP&amp;A Analyst</strong> to help steer a top-tier, fast-scaling AI software company. You will report directly to the Director of FP&amp;A and work on the numbers that drive how Parloa plans, invests and grows. Parloa is AI-forward: our finance processes run on AI, and you will help design and build them.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a rare chance to move from advising companies to helping build one. You will sit close to leadership, shape real decisions and see the impact of your work every week. It suits top performers from investment banking, transaction advisory or audit who know accounting, understand what the numbers mean, and can turn them into forecasts built on solid assumptions, using AI to do it faster and better.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Areas of ownership:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and own financial models and forecasts, from the annual budget to monthly and long-range planning</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set clear, well-reasoned assumptions with business partners and keep them up to date as the business changes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Track performance against plan and explain what is driving the numbers to leadership</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prepare reporting for leadership and the board</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">