&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Written Output:&lt;/strong&gt; Write, edit, and distribute high-quality articles, press releases, and statements that reflect the party’s positions and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social Media Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and post engaging content for our social media platforms, ensuring our messaging remains consistent and impactful.&lt;/li&gt;
