racts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to thrive as a generalist in a fast-paced environment and build practical legal frameworks from first principles.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent written and verbal communication skills across technical, executive, and commercial audiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with data-intensive platforms, AI, or sales technology.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience supporting U.S. tech companies expanding into EMEA</p></li></ul><h3>Preferred Qualifications</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">CIPP/E and/or AIGP certifications </p></li></ul><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/clay-labs/emea-counsel-london-413819","tags":["G&A"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London","created_at":1795675218},{"slug":"remote-sr-account-executive-retail-media-499130","company_name":"Constructor","title":"Sr. Account Executive, Retail Media","description":"<h2>Help retailers turn shopper intent into a growing media business</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Constructor helps e-commerce businesses connect shoppers with the products they want through AI-powered search and product discovery.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for an experienced Retail Media sales professional to help grow our business across EMEA. You’ll work with retailers to understand their monetisation ambitions, build compelling business cases and sell technology that helps them develop and scale their Retail Media offering.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on commercial role—not a campaign-operations position. You’ll combine deep industry knowledge with enterprise sales discipline, working alongside Account Managers and the wider Sales team to turn qualified opportunities into lasting customer partnerships.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p>