on and the relationships between retailers, brands, sellers and agencies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The ability to discuss media performance, measurement and incrementality—and distinguish credible evidence from assumptions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Confidence engaging senior commercial and technical stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong commercial judgment, pipeline discipline and forecasting skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An ability to make complex technology and business models easy to understand.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A collaborative approach: you can lead a specialist sales motion while respecting the broader customer relationship.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Professional fluency in English.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your experience may come from a Retail Media platform, an adtech provider or a retailer’s media business. What matters is your ability to combine industry expertise with demonstrated commercial delivery.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>It would be a bonus if you have</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience selling retailer-facing technology that enables Retail Media networks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with sponsored products, onsite display, auctions or mediation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Familiarity with enterprise e-commerce and product discovery.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working across several EMEA markets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relationships within the European Retail Media ecosystem.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Additional European language skills.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What success looks like</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">You build a qualified pipeline, develop strong customer business cases and convert opportunities into commercial partnerships. Customers understand both the growth opportunity and what it will take to realise it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You also create impact beyond your own deals: Account Managers and Sales colleagues become more confident in Retail Media conversations, customer commitments are clear, and market feedback helps shape a more effective proposition.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Why this role</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Help shape a specialist Retail Media sales motion across EMEA.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work at the intersection of AI-powered commerce, shopper experience and retailer monetisation.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Combine ownership of complex deals with influence on positioning and commercial strategy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with commercial, product and technical teams to turn customer ambitions into actionable plans.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Benefits</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A competitive compensation package including stock options</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fully remote team - choose where you live</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work from home stipend! We want you to have the resources you need to set up your home office</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apple laptops provided for new employees</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Training and development budget for every employee, refreshed each year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Parental leave for qualified employees</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with smart people who will help you grow and make a meaningful impact</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion at Constructor</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">At <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://Constructor.io">Constructor.io</a> we are committed to