orting proposals, RFIs, RFPs, white papers, technical volumes, or complex international capture activities.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our international teammates receive a comprehensive total rewards package aligned to your country office location. For full details on compensation and benefits, please consult your talent acquisition partner.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/shield/field-solutions-engineer-london-368596","tags":["Corporate"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"London, UK","created_at":1795675214},{"slug":"fpa-lead-london-336453","company_name":"Montu Uk","title":"FP&A Lead","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What is the job?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a rare opportunity to help lead FP&amp;A at a pivotal stage in our growth. You will build on the foundations already in place, bringing commercial insight, structure and ambition to how we plan, forecast and make decisions across Montu’s European businesses.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be a trusted partner to leaders across Commercial, Marketing, Technology and the wider business. Your insight will directly shape strategic decisions, investment priorities and business performance at leadership level.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">With significant scope to influence how the function evolves, this role also offers a clear path to building and leading an FP&amp;A team as the business continues to scale.</p><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you will own?</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Financial Planning &amp; Modelling</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set the financial planning cadence for expansion regions, own