ny-paid short-term and long-term disability insurance, plus life insurance to support you and your loved ones.</p></li></ul></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Career growth</strong> 📈 – We hire rising stars who grow with us! You’ll get €1K (or equivalent) per year to spend on courses, books, events, or coaching to level up your skills.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A passionate team</strong> 🤩 – We love our product, and we prove it with regular hackathons where we see who can build the coolest thing with it!</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Remote-first</strong> 🌏 – Our team works remotely across Europe, with regular off-sites for team bonding. Some roles, like sales in the US, are hybrid—please check the job description.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Giving back</strong> 🤝 – We're big fans of open source, and you'll get $100 per month to support projects you care about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transparency</strong> 🙏 – We all know what everyone’s working on, how the company is doing—the whole shebang.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>*Country and/or State specific details provided in your employment agreement.</em></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/n8n/mid-market-sales-leader-emea-remote-united-kingdom-375518","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"United Kingdom","created_at":1795664586},{"slug":"director-people-partnering-gtm-london-10686","company_name":"Multiverse","title":"Director, People Partnering - GTM","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">Every team has AI. Few have mastered it. Humans were built to adapt, but AI is now moving faster than most workforces can.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Multiverse is the AI adoption layer: the missing link between the AI tools that companies have invested in and the people expected to use them.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our ambition is to put AI capability in every worker’s hands. Apprenticeships got us started: we’ve trained over a third of the UK’s data and AI apprentices, worked with a third of the FTSE 100, and generated £2bn+ in verified ROI. Now Mastry, our new adaptive learning platform, takes that further, guiding a company’s AI workforce transformation from start to finish. Mae, our AI guide inside Mastry, is a real-time AI agent that thinks, speaks, listens and sees, working alongside the tools you already use, like Claude and Copilot.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We closed our latest fundraising round in April 2026, with $500m+ raised in total from VC partners including Index Ventures, General Catalyst, Schroders Capital and Lightspeed. With a $2.1bn valuation, we are Europe’s first EdTech double unicorn, and we are just getting started.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want to shape how the workforce wins in the AI era, come and join us.</p><h1><strong>The opportunity</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Multiverse, People Partnering is a driver of commercial performance, not a support function. We measure ourselves on whether the business performs better because we're in the room.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>This role partners our GTM organisation</strong> — Sales, Customer Impact, B2B Marketing, Revenue Operations and Enablement. It's the largest, fastest-moving and most commercially exposed part of the company, and it's where people decisions show up in the numbers fastest.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You'll work directly with our CRO and his leadership layer.</strong> They are sharp, direct, and want a partner who brings a point of view and the data to back it. You'll operate as both advisor and operator: helping leaders make better decisions, and making sure the fundamentals are genuinely excellent underneath.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you'll do:</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Commercial partnering</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner the CRO, Sales SVP and their leadership teams on performance, productivity and team effectiveness.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate commercial targets — pipeline, attainment, retention, revenue per head — into people plans that move those numbers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Coach managers on performance, decision-making and holding a high bar. Challenge senior leaders directly when the call is wrong.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Org design, workforce planning and reward</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Shape GTM org design, role clarity, levelling and spans in service of efficiency, not headcount growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Revenue Operations, Reward and Finance on comp structures, quota and incentive design</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Bring rigour to headcount decisions: every role justified against commercial return.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Performance and talent</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own performance cycles, calibrations and promotion decisions across GTM.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Move early and decisively on performance management; build manager capability to do the same.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build succession depth in a function where key-person risk is real.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Operating well at pace</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run complex ER and restructure work with sound judgement and clean execution.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Apply policy pragmatically and consistently in a fast-moving, commercially pressured environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Use AI to take the operational load out of partnering so your time goes to the work only you can do.</p></li></ul><h1><strong>About you</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3><strong>Essential</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've partnered a quota-carrying sales organisation , not just "commercial" teams generally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've been through an efficiency inflection, not only a growth one. You've helped leaders take cost out of an org without breaking revenue.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're fluent in GTM numbers. Ramp time, attainment distribution, revenue per head, regretted vs non-regretted attrition, cost of sale — you can read them, interrogate them and act on them.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You handle complex performance and ER situations at volume, at pace, with judgement that holds up under scrutiny.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You don’t shy away from having the difficult but right conversation, managing to balance relationships at the same time</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You're highly organised and detail-oriented. You know sustainable impact comes from strong fundamentals, not just good ideas.</p></li></ul><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You already use AI in your own workflow and can show us what you've changed in the last six months. We sell AI enablement; we hold ourselves to it.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br /><br /></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div><div style="left:0px;width:100%;height:0px;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/67cc57bc-fad4-435f-8d49-ddc2f6f20192/4e47c092-8279-464a-ba5a-6e488f33990d" style="top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0px" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Benefits</strong></