ry.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What You'll Do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Qualify leads through discovery calls with senior stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify and break into large multi-region dental groups and corporates across the UK</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build relationships with regional managers, practice managers and clinicians within target groups to drive adoption and new client acquisition</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with an Inside AE to win Large Enterprise accounts through a hybrid approach (you work top-down, the Inside AE works bottom-up)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Navigate multi-stakeholder buying committees, including group CEO or COO, clinical director, finance and procurement</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Meticulously track your sales activity in Salesforce and strive to exceed targets</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a core stakeholder in defining Dandy's large enterprise and strategic sales processes, and help shape the UK playbook, positioning and pricing</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be a student of the UK dental industry, including NHS contracting, private practice economics and group consolidation, and an expert in the Dandy value proposition for this segment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with senior sales leadership to meet KPIs and revenue targets</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What We're Looking For</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">5+ years of sales experience in a high-growth start-up environment (SaaS strongly preferred)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals, ideally with enterprise or multi-site customers, including selling directly to C-suite stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A track record of winning pilots