<div><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Analytical &amp; Data-Savvy: </span>Strong analytical skills are second nature to you, and you're comfortable with data modeling to inform decision-making.</div>
<div><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Team-Oriented: </span>A natural team player, you excel at aligning diverse stakeholders towards common goals.</div>
<div>Proactive &amp; Self-Driven: You’re curious, autonomous, and highly organized, with a proactive approach to problem-solving.</div>
<div><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Technical Acumen: </span>With the technical knowledge needed to effectively engage with engineers, you bridge the gap between product and development.</div>
