rtner Obsessed&lt;/strong&gt; 🤝 — creating tailor-made solutions that better serve our partners and their customers. We’re driven by the challenge of making EV charging simpler and more readily available 💡. And we’re committed to growing relentlessly 📈 — our network, our partners’ businesses, and the professional development of our team.&lt;br&gt;If you’re here, you’re probably not looking for “just a job.” Neither are we. 😎 We’re driven by impact and always looking for people who thrive on turning bold ideas into reality. If that sounds like you, you’ll feel at home here. We’re looking for people who see challenges as opportunities, thrive in fast-growing, high-energy environments, and want to shape the future of mobility, not just watch it unfold. At Powerdot, you’ll get &lt;strong&gt;freedom&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;ownership&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;responsibility&lt;/strong&gt;. The space to experiment. The chance to scale your ideas. And a team that’s always pushing the edge of what’s possible.&lt;/p&gt;
