&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace—which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diverse perspectives, cultures, identities, and lived experiences make us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any accommodations, you may submit a confidential request via the application form. Such requests will have no bearing on the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
