their leaders.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As an Enterprise Account Executive covering Benelux (Belgium and the Netherlands), you will own a territory of larger organisations and drive complex deals from first conversation to signature:</p><h3>GENERATE NEW-LOGO PIPELINE</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and execute account plans for named Enterprise accounts with 1,001 to 5,000 employees.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run outbound campaigns that open doors with CTOs, engineering leaders and platform teams.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn community adoption and inbound signals into structured enterprise opportunities.</p></li></ul><h3>LEAD COMPLEX, MULTI-STAKEHOLDER DEALS</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run deep discovery, quantify business impact and build a business case with your champions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map decision makers across engineering, IT, security and procurement and keep every thread alive.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Solutions Engineers on technical evaluations and proofs of concept.</p></li></ul><h3>CLOSE AND EXPAND</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the sales cycle through security, legal and procurement reviews, typically over two to four months.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiate with confidence and keep clear commercial control of next steps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hand over to Customer Success and plan expansion across teams and use cases.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3>Must-haves</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏢 Enterprise SaaS sales:</strong> You have sold B2B SaaS into organisations of roughly 1,001 to 5,000 employees and can explain customer size, deal complexity and cycle length.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧑‍💻 Technical buyers:</strong> You have sold to developers,