s","Game Development","Remote"],"job_types":["Contract","mid-senior"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1795612812},{"slug":"remote-senior-systems-designer-freelance-talent-pool-2027-opportunities-netherlands-253379","company_name":"Keywords Intl1","title":"Senior Systems Designer - Freelance Talent Pool (2027 Opportunities","description":"<p>This is a fully remote ongoing freelance only position.&nbsp;&nbsp;You will hear directly from our Talent Acquisition team once we have an update for you regarding your application status.</p><p>We are looking for experienced and multi-talented freelance Senior Systems Designer. This is an exciting opportunity to work on a major AAA titles with a team of passionate and highly experienced designers where you will be responsible for some of the game’s moment-to-moment gameplay mechanics and systems. Ideally you will have experience of creating incredible gameplay on other AAA games and being responsible for owning them from start to finish.</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Experience working as a Gameplay Systems Designer creating gameplay features and mechanics on at least one published AAA console title. </li><li>Proven experience working within Unreal Engine 4 or 5, as well as with Blueprinting. </li><li>Experience with working on player movement, abilities and weapons, cameras, and exploration mechanics. </li><li>Ability to rapidly prototype ideas in engine. </li><li>Excellent communication skills to collaborate with a creative &amp; multi-disciplinary team. </li><li>Strong problem solving and analytical skills. </li><li>Enjoys a creative challenge with the passion and motivation to drive features forward and make great gameplay.</li><li>Experience of third-person level design and encounter design is a benefit. </li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Responsibilities </strong></p><ul><li> Create and take ownership of core gameplay systems. </li><li>Work closely with the team and all stakeholders collaboratively throughout the game’s development.</li><li>Create compelling and memorable moment to moment gameplay. </li><li>Create and maintain clear and concise documentation for all the features you are responsible for. </li><li>Keep to project vision for best practices, methodologies used and quality benchmark. </li><li>As part of level reviews, able to accept critique and come up with solutions. </li><li>Regularly play the game and provide suggestions and feedback in a clear and constructive manner. </li><li>Ability to self-motivate as well as working well as part of a team. </li></ul><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/keywords-intl1/remote-senior-systems-designer-freelance-talent-pool-2027-opportunities-netherlands-253379","tags":["Computer Games","Game Development","Remote"],"job_types":["Contract","mid-senior"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1795612812},{"slug":"remote-senior-rendering-graphics-engineer-freelance-talent-pool-2027-opportunities-netherlands-358816","company_name":"Keywords Intl1","title":"Senior Rendering/ Graphics Engineer - Freelance Talent Pool (2027 Opportunities)","description":"<p>This is a fully remote ongoing freelance only position.&nbsp;&nbsp;You will hear directly from our Talent Acquisition team once we have an update for you regarding your application status.</p><p>We are looking for experienced and multi-talented freelance Senior Rendering/ Graphics Engineer to help implement and maintain pipelines. You will ensure that the code is optimized to the highest level, this role is to support and develop the exciting visuals for our games. </p><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul><li>Taking responsibility for graphics development on the project. </li><li>Developing, documenting, testing and maintaining graphical and engine features in collaboration with the other members of the team. </li><li>Dedicatedly and methodically improving the quality and the efficiency of the relevant tools, processes and runtime functionality. </li><li>Troubleshooting of all graphics related issues. </li><li>The research and application of relevant new technologies. </li></ul><p><strong>Responsibilities </strong></p><ul><li>Take ownership of the design and development of key game systems.</li><li>Rapidly gain in-depth knowledge of new technology and development practices.</li><li>Develop best practices and effectively communicate these to other team members and disciplines. </li><li>Effectively profile and optimise game systems.</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Skills</strong> </p><ul><li>A real passion for graphics development. </li><li>We would love to see stellar C++ skills and an exposure to a wide range of graphical techniques and effects. </li><li>Current generation console experience would be our first choice but experience of working with any modern graphics API is also hugely interesting to us. </li><li>Experience with Unreal 4/ 5. </li><li>Vulkan programming experience is a bonus. </li><li>Experience and a deep understanding of high level shader languages. </li><li>Proficiency in maths/3D geometry. </li><li>First class management, communication and scheduling skills.</li></ul><p></p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/keywords-intl1/remote-senior-rendering-graphics-engineer-freelance-talent-pool-2027-opportunities-netherlands-358816","tags":["Engineering","Computer Games","Game Development","Remote"],"job_types":["Contract","mid-senior"],"location":"Netherlands","created_at":1795612812},{"slug":"remote-senior-level-designer-freelance-talent-pool-2027-opportunities-netherlands-292459","company_name":"Keywords Intl1","title":"Senior Level Designer - Freelance Talent Pool (2027 Opportunities","description":"<p>This is a fully remote ongoing fr